			"notes": "This mod adds a handful of new armor materials as well as a Cats Eye Gem Elytra, craftable in the crafting grid by (irrevocably) combining a new Cats Eye Gem chestplate with an Elytra.\n\nBecause ~~I'm lazy~~ ~~overriding entity texture renderers is hard~~ there's no sense in reinventing the wheel, I did this by ~~shamelessly stealing~~ taking advantage of the [`ArmoredElytra` factory](https://github.com/paulevsGitch/BetterEnd/blob/49c0a4f9e1bd574541cdc988db8582477025e9c3/src/main/java/ru/betterend/item/ArmoredElytra.java) from the BetterEnd mod, so **[BetterEnd](https://github.com/paulevsGitch/BetterEnd) and [BCLib](https://github.com/paulevsGitch/BCLib) are now requirements for this mod**."
		},
